# 13. OPENAPI

L'OpenAPI REST è stato recuperato:

/api/openapi.json

Endpoint rilevanti individuati:

/fixture_history/tactics/{fixture_id}
/fixture_history/players/{fixture_id}
/v1/match/{fixture_id}
/v1/match/{fixture_id}/commentary
/commentary/match_events/{fixture_id}
/commentary/match_commentary/{fixture_id}
/player_field_time/{club_id}
/player_field_time/by-player/{player_id}

NON è presente un endpoint REST pubblico evidente che restituisca:

formation_id -> formation definition

